{"4450260": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "666 Malevolence Lane", "steam_appid": 4450260, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>General About</strong><br><br>There are old rumors about the Mansion Deep in the woods, people going missing, Monsters roaming the halls, and a constant feeling of fear around and in the Mansion.<br><br>This is, of course, the perfect place for the local teens to hang out and be nosy, and as such they've become trapped in the halls of the Mansion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Teens</strong><br><br>The Nerd - Ned</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For being in the top of his class, high honors of course, most people would believe he'd see something like this coming.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450260/extras/86744ea11a16a706aec080880d3b419b.avif?t=1776873642\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Jock - Julian</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bravado, Strength and Ego in equal measure, typical for Jocks like himself, thankfully he'd rather protect his friends than claim superiority.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450260/extras/648667583921564d8320a0e4c622f398.avif?t=1776873642\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Popular Girl - Poppy</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She can talk her way into and out of anything she sets her mind to, sadly that does include the Mansion and her Friends.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450260/extras/1ef5a2171f55ae85cbd2f3a0bd653f1e.avif?t=1776873642\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Outcast - Efia </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turns out knowing the rumors and way to a very haunted Mansion makes quick friends, though with the rumors being true she may not have them for long.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Monsters</strong><br>  <br>The Lost Ghost - Forgotten by all and wandering the halls this ghost chases and floats aimlessly until provoked by sound or light.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450260/extras/d3748c3b0a1de456993e3e926adc8124.avif?t=1776873642\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450260/extras_big/d3748c3b0a1de456993e3e926adc8124.webp?t=1776873642 width=1560 height=1040 /></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Mummy Band Kid - A previous victim of the Mansion, now terrorizes the newer teens with tense stand offs and untimely entrances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450260/extras/2bca0ac4e1b4bb03d27ac6394fd38700.avif?t=1776873642\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450260/extras_big/2bca0ac4e1b4bb03d27ac6394fd38700.webp?t=1776873642 width=1560 height=1040 /></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Werewolf Football Player<strong> </strong>- Another Previous Victim of the mansion, now he chases down prey through the halls and beats down doors to feast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450260/extras/124e59aafc6730eb207454fd5cad9a3e.avif?t=1776873642\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450260/extras_big/124e59aafc6730eb207454fd5cad9a3e.webp?t=1776873642 width=1560 height=1040 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Mansion </strong> <br>  <br>Built by Oil Barons in the 1880s, then abandoned in late 1970s, now broken into by the teens in the early 2000s.<strong> </strong>The Mansion has been twisted, malformed and brought to life by the evil forces that live in the walls. It hungers for new souls and sends out the Monsters to bring back new and fear filled victims.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450260/extras/3c89d217078fb7546a53171f2fce171e.avif?t=1776873642\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450260/extras_big/3c89d217078fb7546a53171f2fce171e.avif?t=1776873642 width=1560 height=878 /></span><strong> </strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Minigames</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Minigames are the Mansion focusing non the players to bring them to the brink of sanity before finishing them off. If the players are skillful enough then most of the minigames can be completed and won with little issue. Trials are split up into three types.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sprint</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, Jump, Shove, Trip, Dip, Dive and Dodge the monsters, and other players, as they chase you around maps filled with haunted and twisted objects and furniture!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trial</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save Vases, Dance to Music, and fit yourself into closets to hide from, appease or reduce your noise as the Monsters break down doors!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handling</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix Potions, Build Barricades, or Find the right key to turn invisible, block out the monster or flee before they break down the door!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>General About</strong><br><br>There are old rumors about the Mansion Deep in the woods, people going missing, Monsters roaming the halls, and a constant feeling of fear around and in the Mansion.<br><br>This is, of course, the perfect place for the local teens to hang out and be nosy, and as such they've become trapped in the halls of the Mansion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Teens</strong><br><br>The Nerd - Ned</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For being in the top of his class, high honors of course, most people would believe he'd see something like this coming.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450260/extras/86744ea11a16a706aec080880d3b419b.avif?t=1776873642\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Jock - Julian</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bravado, Strength and Ego in equal measure, typical for Jocks like himself, thankfully he'd rather protect his friends than claim superiority.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4450260/extras/648667583921564d8320a0e4c622f398.avif?t=1776873642\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\